      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Adds <a href=\"../RepositoryProxyPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryProxyPostProcessor</code></a>s to the factory to allow manipulation of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/ProxyFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactory</code></a> before\nthe proxy gets created.",
